# Every text file is checked out with LF, Windows included. With CRLF, npm rewrites the bin scripts
# (a fresh clone showed 35 modified files) and the generated-file checks (readme:check, plugin:check) differ.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Exports from other countries keep their bytes exactly as written (Windows-1252, Shift_JIS, CRLF): that is what they test.
**/fixtures/intl/** -text
**/test/fixtures/** -text
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
